            "mimeType": "image/svg+xml",
            "text": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 20\">\n  <style>\n    .dot {\n      fill: #444444;\n    }\n    \n    /* First dot - starts off-screen left, fades in as it moves right */\n    .dot1 {\n      opacity: 0;\n      animation: dot1-move 0.5s linear infinite;\n    }\n    \n    /* Middle dots - move right together */\n    .dot2, .dot3 {\n      animation: dot23-move 0.5s linear infinite;\n    }\n    \n    /* Last dot - moves right and fades out */\n    .dot4 {\n      animation: dot4-move 0.5s linear infinite;\n    }\n    \n    @keyframes dot1-move {\n      0% {\n        transform: translateX(-5px);\n        opacity: 0;\n      }\n      100% {\n        transform: translateX(5px);\n        opacity: 1;\n      }\n    }\n    \n    @keyframes dot23-move {\n      0% {\n        transform: translateX(0);\n      }\n      100% {\n        transform: translateX(5px);\n      }\n    }\n    \n    @keyframes dot4-move {\n      0% {\n        transform: translateX(0);\n        opacity: 1;\n      }\n      100% {\n        transform: translateX(10px);\n        opacity: 0;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n  \n  <!-- Four dots positioned horizontally -->\n  <circle class=\"dot dot1\" cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/>\n  <circle class=\"dot dot2\" cx=\"17\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/>\n  <circle class=\"dot dot3\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/>\n  <circle class=\"dot dot4\" cx=\"31\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/>\n</svg>"
